        "summary":  "Anthropic launched the Claude Frontier Academy with $100 million in initial funding to train 10,000 Forward Deployed Engineers by end of 2025, while AWS announced two new technical credentials and $1 billion committed to embedding AI deployment experts inside customer teams. The FDE model—engineers embedded directly in enterprise environments to guide AI implementation—is now a cross-industry race, with Google, Microsoft, and DXC all accelerating similar programs. A Gartner estimate suggests the industry could support four times its current 2,000 FDEs, but execution gaps are already visible.",
